WEBVTT

00:00:21.827 --> 00:00:23.329
Yukiya!

00:00:24.497 --> 00:00:26.540
--Yukiya!
--Ryo!

00:00:26.749 --> 00:00:30.252
You can't help him, Ryo!
Alexanders can't travel over water!

00:00:30.461 --> 00:00:32.713
Let go of me! I can't let Yukiya...

00:00:34.465 --> 00:00:36.634
Is that... Akito and Leila?

00:00:36.842 --> 00:00:40.596
Ryo! Ayano! Do you read me?

00:00:40.805 --> 00:00:42.681
Yukiya's in there?

00:00:44.767 --> 00:00:46.769
I've picked up the beacon
from Yukiya's Alexander.

00:00:46.977 --> 00:00:49.271
Akito, you have to save Yukiya!

00:00:49.480 --> 00:00:51.899
| won't let him die this easily!

00:00:53.025 --> 00:00:56.278
What's the matter, Leila? What's happening?

00:00:56.487 --> 00:01:01.283
Was that thing that crashed in the lake
a float system's Sakuradite reactor?

00:01:01.492 --> 00:01:04.120
Yukiya is still inside!

00:01:04.328 --> 00:01:05.287
Yukiya is in there?!

00:01:05.496 --> 00:01:08.999
Anna, think! How can we save Yukiya?!

00:01:10.501 --> 00:01:14.797
Leila, Alexanders are equipped with
emergency shock-absorbing balloons.

00:01:15.005 --> 00:01:17.716
If you access his Alexander's
system and trigger them,

00:01:17.925 --> 00:01:20.177
the cockpit block will be
enveloped by balloons,

00:01:20.386 --> 00:01:22.096
and their buoyancy should
bring it to the surface!

00:01:22.304 --> 00:01:24.765
But how do we access Yukiya's Alexander?

00:01:24.974 --> 00:01:30.229
If Akito uses his BRS, it will link
his and Yukiya's Alexanders.

00:01:30.438 --> 00:01:32.106
Akito, did you get that?

00:01:32.314 --> 00:01:35.734
Activating BRS and taking
control of Yukiya's systems.

00:02:06.015 --> 00:02:07.725
It surfaced!

00:02:07.933 --> 00:02:09.643
It. Col. Warwick! It's Yukiya!

00:02:09.852 --> 00:02:11.353
Take us closer!

00:02:11.562 --> 00:02:12.521
Roger that!

00:02:12.730 --> 00:02:14.815
That chick is your CO?

00:02:15.024 --> 00:02:20.488
Don't call her "that chick."
She's got a name: Leila Malcal.

00:02:20.696 --> 00:02:22.364
So that's Leila, huh?

00:02:49.058 --> 00:02:50.935
Hey, Akito...

00:02:51.143 --> 00:02:55.189
Don't talk. I'm going to save you,
no matter what.

00:02:55.397 --> 00:02:59.568
Is that passion I hear?
That's not really your style, Akito.

00:02:59.777 --> 00:03:02.238
Yeah, it's not.

00:03:02.446 --> 00:03:04.657
Anna, we've successfully retrieved Yukiya.

00:03:04.865 --> 00:03:08.744
He's badly injured, though.
Get word to Dr. Randle at once.

00:03:08.953 --> 00:03:12.790
--Yukiya's hurt?
--Cpt. Clement, what's the matter?

00:03:12.998 --> 00:03:14.458
Cpt. Clement!

00:03:14.667 --> 00:03:17.586
The wZERO Unit and the commander's
party are returning via the tunnels.

00:03:17.795 --> 00:03:18.754
Inform Dr. Randle!

00:03:18.963 --> 00:03:21.757
| know. I'm forwarding her their location data.

00:03:27.680 --> 00:03:30.391
Transport the wounded to the garrison!

00:03:30.599 --> 00:03:32.434
Do a head count of all squads' Knightmares!

00:03:32.643 --> 00:03:36.063
Abandon any irreparable ones
where they're standing!

00:03:37.898 --> 00:03:42.278
Sir Brondello! My squad has
fewer than ten Knightmares left.

00:03:42.486 --> 00:03:45.781
We should count ourselves lucky
that you are safe, Dore.

00:03:45.990 --> 00:03:50.286
Over half of your squad appears
to be undamaged, Sir Scholtz.

00:03:50.494 --> 00:03:55.291
Yes, we were fortunate to have
been at the rear of the formation.

00:03:55.499 --> 00:03:57.293
What are you doing?!

00:03:59.503 --> 00:04:02.965
Grand Master Shaing has
not sounded the retreat!

00:04:03.173 --> 00:04:05.467
Two-thirds of our forces are destroyed!

00:04:05.676 --> 00:04:07.845
We require time to regroup!

00:04:08.053 --> 00:04:10.639
Has the enemy's sneak attack
struck fear into you?

00:04:10.848 --> 00:04:14.476
No knight would force his troops
into a fight devoid of honor!

00:04:14.685 --> 00:04:18.147
But upstarts like you would
know nothing of such things!

00:04:19.148 --> 00:04:20.524
Jean.

00:04:20.733 --> 00:04:21.775
Lord Hyuga?

00:04:21.984 --> 00:04:26.322
| was listening. Have the Three
Swordmasters pull back for now.

00:04:26.530 --> 00:04:28.032
Are you sure, sir?

00:04:28.240 --> 00:04:33.704
| shall test their mettle as knights
to the fullest soon enough.

00:04:43.088 --> 00:04:47.843
I will kill them. I will kill everything.

00:04:54.516 --> 00:04:56.518
Suzaku...

00:04:56.727 --> 00:04:58.228
Give me water...

00:05:00.564 --> 00:05:04.151
Could you give me some water? Please?

00:05:35.808 --> 00:05:37.393
Suzaku...

00:05:40.270 --> 00:05:43.607
Kill me, Suzaku...

00:05:58.997 --> 00:06:00.124
Suzaku...

00:06:00.332 --> 00:06:03.460
Please, Suzaku?

00:06:05.003 --> 00:06:08.882
Let's go get her. Together.

00:06:09.091 --> 00:06:11.385
Let's go fetch Nunnally.

00:06:13.011 --> 00:06:19.518
"150 kilometers east of Warsaw
Eastern Front"

00:06:31.989 --> 00:06:37.536
We've received reports that Lord Shaing
has seized power in Euro Britannia!

00:06:38.662 --> 00:06:40.664
Lord Shaing is an Eleven, as I recall.

00:06:40.873 --> 00:06:42.875
Reports say as much, sir!

00:06:43.083 --> 00:06:46.211
The Elevens are a race that
mustn't be underestimated.

00:06:56.680 --> 00:06:59.725
| told him to jump ship right away, damn it!

00:06:59.933 --> 00:07:03.479
You're always dawdling! Yukiya, you dummy...

00:07:03.687 --> 00:07:07.900
The bleeding from the pancreatic
artery is bad, but I think I can fix it.

00:07:08.108 --> 00:07:10.861
| just hope this channel holds out that long.

00:07:11.069 --> 00:07:14.948
I've never performed telesurgery on
a patient in a secret location before.

00:07:15.157 --> 00:07:17.659
I'm just doing this as a favor to you, Sophie.

00:07:17.868 --> 00:07:19.953
| appreciate it, David.

00:07:20.162 --> 00:07:22.498
Then give me your word, Sophie.

00:07:22.706 --> 00:07:25.876
--Promise you what?
--That when Takeru wakes up,

00:07:26.084 --> 00:07:28.504
I'll be the first person you call.

00:07:29.880 --> 00:07:36.011
| don't know where you are right now,
but you're with Takeru, right?

00:07:37.346 --> 00:07:39.723
Thank you, David.

00:07:39.932 --> 00:07:41.683
You have my word.

00:07:41.892 --> 00:07:43.519
I'll hold you to that.

00:07:43.727 --> 00:07:46.522
| have more losses than wins
against Takeru in chess.

00:07:46.730 --> 00:07:48.524
| want a chance to break even.

00:07:48.732 --> 00:07:54.112
Tell him to wake his ass up, Sophie.
| don't care if it takes a miracle.

00:07:57.825 --> 00:08:00.202
I'm told that Yukiya's surgery was a success.

00:08:00.410 --> 00:08:03.914
Two-thirds of the enemy's forces
are dead thanks to Yukiya,

00:08:04.122 --> 00:08:07.000
but they still have overwhelming
numerical superiority.

00:08:07.209 --> 00:08:08.961
I'll have Major Hammel's security team

00:08:09.169 --> 00:08:11.046
pilot Alexanders as well.

00:08:11.255 --> 00:08:14.466
Well, Hammel's team is really just support...

00:08:16.885 --> 00:08:20.889
The latest data just came in from Cpt. Clement.

00:08:21.098 --> 00:08:22.850
What about the Drones?

00:08:23.058 --> 00:08:28.814
Sounds like we'll have ten, max.
The parts were used in Hammel's Alexanders.

00:08:29.022 --> 00:08:31.733
What about the Alexander that I piloted once?

00:08:31.942 --> 00:08:34.236
Maj. Hammel will use it.

00:08:34.444 --> 00:08:36.071
| see...

00:08:36.280 --> 00:08:38.615
Don't you have a Knightmare for me to pilot?

00:08:38.824 --> 00:08:41.243
You'll be way tougher with me on your side.

00:08:41.451 --> 00:08:45.289
We're facing the Holy Order of Michael.
That's your former unit.

00:08:45.497 --> 00:08:49.084
Lord Shaing tried to kill me!

00:08:49.293 --> 00:08:52.296
Plus, I owe Akito one.

00:08:59.136 --> 00:09:01.179
Pops! I'm gonna grab these!

00:09:02.973 --> 00:09:04.850
Learn some manners...

00:09:05.934 --> 00:09:10.272
Ashley, I'll entrust an Alexander to you.

00:09:10.480 --> 00:09:13.108
| also think that's a fine idea, Commander.

00:09:13.317 --> 00:09:16.028
Leila, you're a smart girl!

00:09:17.487 --> 00:09:21.992
This Knightmare data we got from that
red-haired boy has certainly been useful,

00:09:22.200 --> 00:09:23.619
hasn't it, Sgt. Hilda?

00:09:23.827 --> 00:09:27.915
His name is "Ashley," Sgt. Chloe.

00:09:28.123 --> 00:09:31.752
We wouldn't be using Schrétter Steel
if it weren't for Ashley.

00:09:31.960 --> 00:09:34.963
It was rough on the boss to make
all the design alterations, though.

00:09:35.172 --> 00:09:38.258
Yeah, she had to revise two whole designs:
the new Alexander model,

00:09:38.467 --> 00:09:40.761
and Akito's upgraded model.

00:09:40.969 --> 00:09:43.513
The boss sure is amazing.

00:09:44.514 --> 00:09:50.562
Yes, even though military-use
robotics are beneath her.

00:09:59.112 --> 00:10:02.324
The elbow motor is fried!
Do we have any spares?

00:10:02.532 --> 00:10:06.078
Not in stock! Grab one
from one of the scrap units!

00:10:06.286 --> 00:10:08.914
There's not much we can do
without fresh supplies.

00:10:09.122 --> 00:10:12.668
There's no choice. We have to
make do with what we've got.

00:10:17.547 --> 00:10:19.257
Lord Hyuga...

00:10:28.850 --> 00:10:29.726
Hey.

00:10:29.935 --> 00:10:31.853
Ashley!

00:10:32.062 --> 00:10:33.397
What are you doing in that uniform?!

00:10:33.605 --> 00:10:36.024
| have something to say to you.

00:10:36.233 --> 00:10:37.234
To me?

00:10:37.442 --> 00:10:39.987
You and I are two of a kind.

00:10:40.195 --> 00:10:44.825
Our parents abandoned us as kids,
and just when we were at death's door,

00:10:45.033 --> 00:10:47.369
we were taken in by Lord Shaing.

00:10:47.577 --> 00:10:48.620
So we both owe him our--

00:10:48.829 --> 00:10:50.789
He's changed.

00:10:50.998 --> 00:10:55.127
| don't know how or why,
but it's like he's possessed.

00:10:55.335 --> 00:10:56.962
By Death.

00:10:58.839 --> 00:11:04.094
But a buddy of mine says he wants
to save Lord Shaing all the same.

00:11:05.429 --> 00:11:07.014
Cause they're brothers.

00:11:09.099 --> 00:11:11.268
Akito Hyuga...

00:11:11.476 --> 00:11:16.398
Jean... You said you went by Jeanne
when he found you, right?

00:11:17.482 --> 00:11:22.195
Jeanne, I think we should help him out.

00:11:22.404 --> 00:11:27.993
The only person who can save
Shin Hyuga from the darkness is Akito.

00:12:15.999 --> 00:12:18.835
Very well, let us begin.

00:12:19.961 --> 00:12:21.797
All forces, begin advance!

00:12:26.426 --> 00:12:28.678
We'll show him the honor of Michael!

00:12:28.887 --> 00:12:30.388
Right!

00:12:32.140 --> 00:12:34.226
Dore, I'm going in first!!

00:12:34.434 --> 00:12:37.020
Good hunting, Sir Scholtz!

00:12:58.250 --> 00:13:00.168
It's no use! It can't punch through!

00:13:00.377 --> 00:13:03.004
Have the Canterbury move up
to shorten the range!

00:13:03.213 --> 00:13:04.714
Advance!

00:13:13.348 --> 00:13:16.852
--Don't you have visuals yet?!
--I'm working on it!

00:13:17.060 --> 00:13:17.853
Got it!

00:13:18.061 --> 00:13:21.148
8 o'clock! Range, 250!

00:13:21.356 --> 00:13:22.983
Commencing counterattack!

00:13:29.197 --> 00:13:31.241
Taking fire from enemy wall!

00:13:32.742 --> 00:13:35.370
Close the distance! Don't back off!

00:13:37.080 --> 00:13:39.166
Protect the Canterbury's legs!

00:13:39.374 --> 00:13:42.043
Alpha Platoon, move up! Don't fall back!

00:13:47.465 --> 00:13:49.801
Hang in there! We'll fall back temporarily!

00:13:53.054 --> 00:13:54.848
Lord Shaing...

00:13:55.056 --> 00:13:57.642
Retreat will not be tolerated.

00:13:58.810 --> 00:14:00.896
I'll shoot you if you fall back.

00:14:01.104 --> 00:14:02.898
Wh-Why, you...

00:14:03.106 --> 00:14:05.358
Would you kindly show me...

00:14:07.235 --> 00:14:11.072
...this "knight's honor" of yours, Sir Brondello?

00:14:18.663 --> 00:14:21.416
Crack in sector A23!

00:14:28.423 --> 00:14:31.009
--Good, we're latched on!
--Let's move!

00:14:31.218 --> 00:14:34.012
Knightmares climbing in through sector A17!

00:14:35.138 --> 00:14:36.640
Eliminate them.

00:14:45.357 --> 00:14:47.192
It's no use! We can't advance any further!

00:14:47.400 --> 00:14:50.070
We've lost contact with Alpha Platoon!

00:14:50.278 --> 00:14:54.032
We might be out of men by the time
we finally storm the castle...

00:14:54.241 --> 00:14:55.200
Dore!

00:14:55.408 --> 00:14:57.369
My squad will make an opening!

00:15:00.538 --> 00:15:02.332
The rest will be up to you.

00:15:02.540 --> 00:15:06.169
Understood. Wait for me with Lord Manfredi.

00:15:06.378 --> 00:15:10.465
I'm looking forward to being
reunited with you on the other side.

00:15:10.674 --> 00:15:12.175
Farewell!

00:15:26.731 --> 00:15:30.443
--Explosion detected, sector A23!
--Defensive wall crumbling!

00:15:30.652 --> 00:15:34.072
"Disposable pawn" is the ideal role for fools.

00:15:34.281 --> 00:15:36.783
Will now mount a charge
into the enemy castle!

00:15:39.327 --> 00:15:41.246
There it is! Going in!

00:15:45.542 --> 00:15:49.462
Knightmare squad has made it through
the old gate and has entered the castle!

00:15:50.463 --> 00:15:52.716
Make for the enemy command center!

00:16:02.434 --> 00:16:05.228
--Path is blocked!
--Rescue the wounded!

00:16:05.437 --> 00:16:08.106
Getting to them won't be so simple, eh?

00:16:18.450 --> 00:16:20.702
WWZERO Squad, stand by to counterattack.

00:16:20.910 --> 00:16:24.080
Cpt. Hyuga, stand by to launch! Do you copy?

00:16:24.289 --> 00:16:25.790
Cpt. Hyuga!

00:16:27.625 --> 00:16:30.420
| think this baby's gonna be perfect for me.

00:16:30.628 --> 00:16:32.964
Why the hell do you get the new one?!

00:16:33.173 --> 00:16:34.257
Quit your bitching.

00:16:34.466 --> 00:16:36.259
Come again?!

00:16:41.514 --> 00:16:43.933
There they are! Open fire!

00:16:46.728 --> 00:16:50.190
--The enemy! Scatter!
--Up top! They're above us!

00:16:51.858 --> 00:16:54.444
Fall back! All units, scatter!

00:17:02.702 --> 00:17:04.204
It's an ambush!

00:17:33.900 --> 00:17:38.738
I'm Ashley Ashra! If anybody wants to try
themselves against me, come on out!

00:17:38.947 --> 00:17:40.490
It's the Ghost of Hannibal!

00:17:40.698 --> 00:17:42.700
The Ashra Force's Ashley, eh?

00:17:42.909 --> 00:17:44.828
We'll make a concentrated push!

00:17:46.621 --> 00:17:49.666
--Here they come!
--This will be fun!

00:18:18.069 --> 00:18:19.612
He's here.

00:18:29.372 --> 00:18:32.375
One enemy Knightmare
approaching at high speed!

00:18:32.584 --> 00:18:34.669
--Do you have a visual?
--Just a moment!

00:18:34.878 --> 00:18:36.379
Got it!

00:18:37.630 --> 00:18:39.549
It's the four-legged Knightmare!

00:18:40.592 --> 00:18:44.971
All forces, advance into the castle.
We'll take the command center.

00:19:01.613 --> 00:19:06.201
Lord Shaing! Just when I thought
you couldn't get any more cowardly!

00:19:06.409 --> 00:19:07.952
Is that you, Ashley?

00:19:10.747 --> 00:19:13.750
You begged and were given
a Europian Knightmare, I see.

00:19:13.958 --> 00:19:15.543
Bastard!

00:19:15.752 --> 00:19:16.711
This is bad, Akito!

00:19:16.920 --> 00:19:18.421
He got past us!

00:19:19.422 --> 00:19:20.965
Lord Shaing!

00:19:24.010 --> 00:19:26.679
I'll kill you, too.

00:19:26.888 --> 00:19:30.558
Wait in the nether world for
your comrades to join you.

00:19:30.767 --> 00:19:33.353
It will be my parting gift to you!

00:19:33.561 --> 00:19:35.772
You son of a bitch!

00:19:39.609 --> 00:19:40.401
Ashley!

00:19:40.610 --> 00:19:42.362
You're too close!

00:19:47.325 --> 00:19:51.704
Brother! What point is there to fighting?!

00:19:51.913 --> 00:19:54.415
The destruction of this world

00:19:54.624 --> 00:19:57.669
is my goal, Akito.

00:19:59.796 --> 00:20:01.714
Die, Akito!

00:20:01.923 --> 00:20:06.469
Destroy the world... and die!

00:20:06.678 --> 00:20:07.845
Wha...?

00:20:08.054 --> 00:20:09.931
Fighting still underway in sector 23!

00:20:10.139 --> 00:20:12.642
Akito, Ryo, and Ashley's frames
are all running at full power...

00:20:12.850 --> 00:20:14.727
They're on the verge of overloading!

00:20:18.940 --> 00:20:20.900
Commander.

00:20:21.109 --> 00:20:22.902
| have a favor to ask.

00:20:25.071 --> 00:20:27.490
Would you mind keeping this?

00:20:27.699 --> 00:20:29.200
Akito?

00:20:31.536 --> 00:20:37.500
If I die in this battle and
there's nothing left, bury this.

00:20:37.709 --> 00:20:39.419
You make certain...

00:20:40.920 --> 00:20:42.922
...that you come back.

00:20:45.758 --> 00:20:48.303
I---

00:20:48.511 --> 00:20:51.848
There's more that I want
to talk to you about, Akito.

00:20:52.056 --> 00:20:53.683
So please...

00:20:53.891 --> 00:20:59.063
Promise me that you'll
return here with everyone.

00:21:01.065 --> 00:21:04.485
Another Order of Michael Knightmare squad
is coming in through the old gate!

00:21:04.694 --> 00:21:07.405
Commence defensive operation #4.

00:21:10.241 --> 00:21:12.118
Here they come! Akito!

00:21:14.037 --> 00:21:16.748
--Son of a...
--Ashley.

00:21:16.956 --> 00:21:18.499
We're falling back to sector 18.

00:21:18.708 --> 00:21:20.293
All right, fine!

00:21:31.888 --> 00:21:33.806
Have arrived at middle gate!

00:21:34.015 --> 00:21:35.808
Platoon now entering!

00:21:36.017 --> 00:21:38.811
The enemy counterattack has ceased?

00:21:39.020 --> 00:21:40.063
Oh, no!

00:21:40.271 --> 00:21:41.064
Four!

00:21:41.272 --> 00:21:42.065
Three!

00:21:42.273 --> 00:21:43.316
Two!

00:21:43.524 --> 00:21:45.026
One!

00:21:51.574 --> 00:21:53.618
A-Ayano...

00:21:53.826 --> 00:21:55.828
Ayano...

00:21:56.037 --> 00:21:57.080
Yukiya!

00:21:57.288 --> 00:21:58.581
Where am I?

00:21:58.790 --> 00:22:01.918
Yukiya! Thank goodness, Yukiya!

00:22:02.126 --> 00:22:05.046
--Ow!
--S-Sorry!

00:22:05.254 --> 00:22:09.050
I... How long have I been out?

00:22:09.258 --> 00:22:11.886
Six days. Today's the seventh.

00:22:12.095 --> 00:22:15.598
Oh. It's been seven days?

00:22:15.807 --> 00:22:18.017
Is everyone...

00:22:18.226 --> 00:22:19.644
Oh, no!

00:22:19.852 --> 00:22:21.979
What are you doing?
You can't get out of bed yet!

00:22:22.188 --> 00:22:25.650
| have to... I have to tell Leila right away!

00:22:25.858 --> 00:22:31.906
Mariko and Shinji told me. We're the
only ones who can protect the world!

00:22:33.700 --> 00:22:35.743
Explosion confirmed in sector 23!

00:22:35.952 --> 00:22:37.787
Elimination of enemy
Knightmare squad successful!

00:22:37.995 --> 00:22:40.915
Enemy Knightmare squad
on sector 4 castle wall!

00:22:43.918 --> 00:22:45.461
Change ammunition type to cluster warhead.

00:22:45.670 --> 00:22:48.214
--Loading complete!
--Locked on to target!

00:22:52.927 --> 00:22:54.846
Fall back! Hurry!

00:22:59.851 --> 00:23:03.521
Impacts in and around sector 25!
Enemy artillery fire!

00:23:03.730 --> 00:23:05.606
Leila, do you copy?

00:23:05.815 --> 00:23:06.774
Ayano?

00:23:06.983 --> 00:23:09.026
Have my and Yukiya's Alexanders repped.

00:23:09.235 --> 00:23:11.112
What's the matter? Is Yukiya all right?

00:23:11.320 --> 00:23:12.989
I'm fine...

00:23:17.285 --> 00:23:22.832
Leila, I finally figured it out...

00:23:23.040 --> 00:23:26.836
That hating the world doesn't do any good.

00:23:30.131 --> 00:23:33.009
If it's to help my friends,

00:23:33.217 --> 00:23:37.096
| can love the world.

00:23:43.853 --> 00:23:45.563
--They're here!
--Stay calm!

00:23:45.772 --> 00:23:47.857
We'll hold this position to the last man!

00:23:54.071 --> 00:23:56.616
Enemy forces have entered sector 13!

00:23:56.824 --> 00:23:58.993
They're climbing over the northwestern wall!

00:24:04.040 --> 00:24:06.292
We're only after the enemy commander!

00:24:08.211 --> 00:24:09.962
Firing MPA cannon!

00:24:15.426 --> 00:24:17.470
Target that cannon with launchers!

00:24:56.425 --> 00:24:58.928
Enemy troops are massing
at the control tower!

00:24:59.929 --> 00:25:01.931
--Olivia.
--I know.

00:25:03.724 --> 00:25:06.644
We're the only ones who
know how to use these.

00:25:06.853 --> 00:25:08.729
| just hope we don't have to use them.

00:25:10.773 --> 00:25:12.984
Lord Hyuga, we just finished rewriting

00:25:13.192 --> 00:25:16.195
the transport's flight program
at the launch site.

00:25:16.404 --> 00:25:19.866
As soon as it's prepped, launch it.

00:25:23.953 --> 00:25:25.538
Jean.

00:25:25.746 --> 00:25:30.918
We'll soon bring destruction
down upon everything.

00:25:31.127 --> 00:25:32.837
Lord Hyuga...

00:25:36.465 --> 00:25:40.052
Freeze! Make one move,
and I'll fire on your cockpit!

00:25:41.137 --> 00:25:44.932
Resistance is useless. Step out
of your Knightmare at once!

00:25:52.982 --> 00:25:54.483
That's...

00:26:04.911 --> 00:26:08.539
So, you must be the "lady knight"
that Ashley told us about.

00:26:11.459 --> 00:26:13.836
Ashley told us everything.

00:26:14.045 --> 00:26:16.088
Shut your mouth and lie on the floor.

00:26:16.297 --> 00:26:24.889
Do you really think it's okay to bomb
Pendragon and destroy the world?

00:26:25.097 --> 00:26:26.974
| said to get on the floor!

00:26:27.183 --> 00:26:32.229
| know what it's like to want to do
whatever the person you love says.

00:26:34.106 --> 00:26:37.944
But you have to do more than that.

00:26:38.152 --> 00:26:39.654
Stay back!

00:26:42.531 --> 00:26:44.951
If you really want to do
what's best for that person...

00:26:45.159 --> 00:26:47.662
Stop!

00:26:47.870 --> 00:26:49.664
...you can't just do what they--

00:26:51.582 --> 00:26:54.043
They'll never know how you feel that way.

00:26:54.251 --> 00:26:56.921
My feelings are irrelevant.

00:26:57.129 --> 00:27:01.133
Lord Hyuga's wishes... Lord Hyuga's desires!

00:27:01.342 --> 00:27:03.844
| want to make them come true!

00:27:05.054 --> 00:27:10.935
Even if you give him everything he wants,
he still won't be happy.

00:27:24.407 --> 00:27:26.367
What should I...

00:27:26.575 --> 00:27:30.621
What should I do?

00:27:41.590 --> 00:27:43.175
Die...

00:27:52.435 --> 00:27:55.187
Signal from ultra-high altitude
observation balloon has cut out!

00:27:55.396 --> 00:27:58.315
Remain calm! We can still compute
enemy positions with just sensors!

00:27:58.524 --> 00:28:00.026
Y
es, ma'am!

00:28:03.237 --> 00:28:05.322
Stop it!

00:28:06.490 --> 00:28:10.703
Fools should die!

00:28:10.911 --> 00:28:12.538
No!

00:28:23.466 --> 00:28:24.967
We're too close! Get some distance!

00:28:25.176 --> 00:28:26.677
You're wrong...

00:28:29.638 --> 00:28:31.515
It. Naruse?

00:28:35.144 --> 00:28:38.189
With big enemies, you have to get in close
and get into their blind spot!

00:28:38.397 --> 00:28:40.941
--He's coming at us!
--Shoot! Shoot him!

00:28:44.153 --> 00:28:47.323
--He's in our blind spot!
--Target him with antipersonnel cannon!

00:28:49.450 --> 00:28:51.786
--Die, Akito!
--I won't!

00:28:51.994 --> 00:28:54.371
--It's no use! Take evasive!
--Bye, bye.

00:28:56.248 --> 00:28:57.917
Yukiya!

00:29:01.378 --> 00:29:05.382
Bastards, we're not letting you get any closer!

00:29:05.591 --> 00:29:09.345
They're swarming at us like bugs!
I'm gonna squash 'em!

00:29:16.393 --> 00:29:17.937
Akito!

00:29:20.564 --> 00:29:22.316
I'm getting a spike in Akito's brainwaves!

00:29:22.525 --> 00:29:25.986
--The BRS is entering an entangle phase?
--It's a wave resonance!

00:29:26.195 --> 00:29:28.948
Sayama and Ashley are both completely
synchronized with Cpt. Hyuga!

00:29:29.156 --> 00:29:31.325
BRS operation rate?

00:29:31.534 --> 00:29:33.661
It's over 300%!

00:29:40.751 --> 00:29:42.253
Akito!

00:29:44.755 --> 00:29:46.549
Akito's vanished?!

00:29:56.642 --> 00:29:58.310
"Where am I?"

00:30:04.733 --> 00:30:08.112
Young Master, congratulations.

00:30:08.320 --> 00:30:10.656
You have a little brother.

00:30:16.203 --> 00:30:19.081
Shin, this is your little brother.

00:30:19.290 --> 00:30:21.584
Come and introduce yourself.

00:30:23.043 --> 00:30:25.004
My... little brother?

00:30:25.212 --> 00:30:26.463
--Congratulations!
--Congratulations!

00:30:26.672 --> 00:30:29.341
--Congratulations!
--Congratulations! --Congratulations!

00:30:29.550 --> 00:30:32.553
"In that instant, I knew.

00:30:32.761 --> 00:30:36.098
| knew who Akito's real father was."

00:30:38.184 --> 00:30:41.061
Sara! What are the coordinates of Akito
and the enemy Knightmare?!

00:30:41.270 --> 00:30:45.232
| lost them! All of a sudden...
their signals vanished!

00:30:45.441 --> 00:30:47.610
Why did this have to happen now?!

00:30:47.818 --> 00:30:51.906
The brainwave resonance
is affecting spacetime...

00:30:52.114 --> 00:30:54.700
Is this... a singularity?!

00:30:57.161 --> 00:30:59.121
You should kill me, as well.

00:30:59.330 --> 00:31:03.209
If I die, I can be free from you.

00:31:03.417 --> 00:31:05.169
How foolish...

00:31:05.377 --> 00:31:11.342
Your betrayal amounts to nothing under
the guiding principles of this world.

00:31:12.635 --> 00:31:14.887
| shall forgive you.

00:31:15.095 --> 00:31:21.352
Remaining at my side until your death
will be your punishment for your sin.

00:31:21.560 --> 00:31:23.437
How can you be so...

00:31:24.647 --> 00:31:26.941
"How disgusting."

00:31:27.149 --> 00:31:32.529
"| feel nothing but despair over
being born from this woman's womb."

00:31:32.738 --> 00:31:34.406
"But..."

00:31:34.615 --> 00:31:37.409
"...she is still our mother."

00:31:37.618 --> 00:31:40.287
It's fused with Akito's waveform?

00:31:40.496 --> 00:31:43.123
No, it looks like they're resonating.

00:31:43.332 --> 00:31:45.668
Joe Wise! Are you sure this
isn't a telemetry malfunction?

00:31:45.876 --> 00:31:48.587
Yes! I'm not seeing any program errors!

00:31:48.796 --> 00:31:52.299
--The BRS values indicate an anomaly!
--There's noise!

00:31:52.508 --> 00:31:56.095
The coordinates of all Alexanders are
too jumbled to get a fix on their location!

00:31:56.303 --> 00:31:58.055
Impossible--a Penrose effect?

00:31:58.264 --> 00:32:00.557
Show me the correlation between the
brainwaves and spacetime parameters!

00:32:00.766 --> 00:32:03.686
You want a comparison display of
mental and physical phenomena?

00:32:03.894 --> 00:32:05.145
Yes.

00:32:05.354 --> 00:32:09.525
The brainwave anomaly is clearly
causing the coordinate scrambling.

00:32:09.733 --> 00:32:12.278
Are you saying that the human mind--
the subconscious--

00:32:12.486 --> 00:32:15.239
Is affecting the physical world?

00:32:15.447 --> 00:32:17.366
Probably. The world only becomes fixed

00:32:17.574 --> 00:32:21.245
through the act of an observer observing it.

00:32:21.453 --> 00:32:25.958
By using the BRS system to entangle
the brains of multiple people,

00:32:26.166 --> 00:32:30.462
we're creating an observer
more powerful than any other.

00:32:30.671 --> 00:32:35.009
Our universe is formed by the brains
of intelligent beings observing events,

00:32:35.217 --> 00:32:37.970
and those brains are created by the universe.

00:32:38.178 --> 00:32:41.682
When you gaze long into an abyss,
the abyss also gazes into you.

00:32:41.890 --> 00:32:44.643
That transcends time and space

00:32:44.852 --> 00:32:51.025
and makes it possible to alter the past,
or even to create a new universe.

00:32:51.233 --> 00:32:53.777
A new universe?

00:33:05.581 --> 00:33:07.082
Let's move!

00:33:10.252 --> 00:33:12.755
Intruders are breaching
final defensive perimeter!

00:33:12.963 --> 00:33:14.465
Oh, no!

00:33:29.313 --> 00:33:31.523
Do you want power?

00:33:36.362 --> 00:33:38.781
If that is your desire...

00:33:38.989 --> 00:33:43.494
Yes... If you give me power,

00:33:43.702 --> 00:33:46.038
I'll destroy the world.

00:33:46.246 --> 00:33:49.666
| shall bestow my power upon all those

00:33:49.875 --> 00:33:52.795
who hate this world.

00:33:55.297 --> 00:34:00.260
| am worthy of using that power!

00:34:00.469 --> 00:34:04.598
But this power will isolate you!

00:34:06.558 --> 00:34:11.146
I'm not afraid of being alone.
In fact, I welcome it.

00:34:24.410 --> 00:34:25.619
They're in the corridors!

00:34:25.828 --> 00:34:27.746
All personnel, take shelter
in the command post!

00:34:27.955 --> 00:34:30.332
--Chloe!
--Hilda, I'm scared!

00:34:31.500 --> 00:34:32.793
Chloe! Hilda!

00:34:33.001 --> 00:34:34.795
Don't shoot! We're--

00:34:39.675 --> 00:34:41.427
Commander!

00:34:41.635 --> 00:34:44.012
Hold your fire! Stop shooting!

00:34:48.517 --> 00:34:50.310
How did it come to this?

00:34:57.734 --> 00:34:59.945
It. Col. Warwick...

00:35:05.492 --> 00:35:09.746
Anna? Dr. Randle?

00:35:09.955 --> 00:35:13.667
It. Col. Warwick? Everyone...

00:35:22.342 --> 00:35:25.345
--"Where am I?"
--Hello, Mademoiselle.

00:35:25.554 --> 00:35:29.516
What seems to be the trouble?
Are you looking for something?

00:35:30.893 --> 00:35:34.521
Bradow, this woman is a soldier.

00:35:34.730 --> 00:35:36.565
It's rude to call her "Mademoiselle."

00:35:36.773 --> 00:35:38.442
Oh, of course.

00:35:38.650 --> 00:35:40.611
--I've never seen that uniform before,
--"Father and Mother?"

00:35:40.819 --> 00:35:43.322
But it's very fetching.

00:35:43.530 --> 00:35:44.323
--Akito!
--Akito!

00:35:44.531 --> 00:35:46.867
--Akito!
--Akito!!

00:36:05.802 --> 00:36:08.889
Boy, you have potential.

00:36:09.097 --> 00:36:13.435
In Britannia, even if you are Japanese,
if you hone your fighting skills,

00:36:13.644 --> 00:36:15.312
you can become a knight.

00:36:17.439 --> 00:36:19.441
Look, Mother!

00:36:19.650 --> 00:36:21.777
Isn't it a lovely boat?

00:36:23.695 --> 00:36:27.324
Alice. I think that's enough.

00:36:27.533 --> 00:36:29.576
Your hands are ice cold already.

00:36:29.785 --> 00:36:31.537
Brother...

00:36:48.136 --> 00:36:49.429
They're all...

00:36:49.638 --> 00:36:53.517
The balance between intellect
and instinct is terrible in humans.

00:36:53.725 --> 00:36:56.770
Don't you agree, Leila?

00:36:57.980 --> 00:37:00.357
Who are you?

00:37:02.568 --> 00:37:04.945
| am no one.

00:37:05.153 --> 00:37:08.490
To humans, I am someone who does not exist.

00:37:08.699 --> 00:37:10.993
But I exist to those who can see me.

00:37:11.201 --> 00:37:12.786
Just like the witch in the forest...

00:37:12.995 --> 00:37:16.665
She's a human being. Just like you.

00:37:18.500 --> 00:37:23.797
Maybe it would be easier for you
to think of me--no, of "us"--

00:37:24.006 --> 00:37:26.842
as a collective consciousness.

00:37:27.050 --> 00:37:30.470
Or a being who influences
the evolution of the universe.

00:37:30.679 --> 00:37:35.309
Are you saying that you determine our fates?

00:37:35.517 --> 00:37:36.977
Not at all.

00:37:37.185 --> 00:37:39.896
You sought out power and gained it.

00:37:40.105 --> 00:37:43.442
But that power is a bit different.

00:37:43.650 --> 00:37:47.863
| only want everyone to be happy.

00:37:48.071 --> 00:37:52.701
At the root of the desires of all lifeforms
is the desire to continue to exist.

00:37:54.202 --> 00:37:58.498
Eventually, they all will go extinct
and vanish from this spacetime, though.

00:37:58.707 --> 00:38:02.294
But right now, we're alive and exist here.

00:38:02.502 --> 00:38:06.715
True. There is a beauty to be found
in your ephemeral nature.

00:38:08.717 --> 00:38:12.846
Your power is a fragment of the Geass.

00:38:13.055 --> 00:38:14.431
A fragment?

00:38:14.640 --> 00:38:18.310
The Geass might have been
too much for humans.

00:38:18.518 --> 00:38:22.022
| think that we should
retrieve it from this world.

00:38:22.230 --> 00:38:23.857
The Geass?

00:38:25.651 --> 00:38:31.406
| once thought that humans weren't
very impressive as lifeforms went.

00:38:31.615 --> 00:38:35.452
So you had neither the ability
nor the right to use the Geass.

00:38:35.661 --> 00:38:37.537
That you would be better off extinct.

00:38:37.746 --> 00:38:39.373
Please, wait!

00:38:41.041 --> 00:38:43.669
But this might be an opportunity

00:38:43.877 --> 00:38:46.630
for you to prove me wrong.

00:38:50.592 --> 00:38:55.263
Assuming you are able to stop that man
with his perverted Geass, that is.

00:39:01.728 --> 00:39:04.064
Explosion detected at base of control tower!

00:39:08.694 --> 00:39:11.905
--Chloe! Liberte status?
--Still no signal!!

00:39:12.114 --> 00:39:13.699
Joe Wise! Record this!

00:39:13.907 --> 00:39:16.493
<i>Yes, ma'am! Already recording!</i>

00:39:17.828 --> 00:39:18.829
Hilda, what's this?

00:39:19.037 --> 00:39:23.125
--Ashley's out of control!
--Doctor! I'm sending you the brainwave measurement data!

00:39:23.333 --> 00:39:26.586
Intruders are breaching
final defensive perimeter!

00:39:26.795 --> 00:39:29.881
--Inject bulkheads with anti-explosion gel!
--Roger!

00:39:36.304 --> 00:39:38.932
Sir Brondello, we can't destroy this door!

00:39:39.141 --> 00:39:40.684
A blast-proof hatch, eh?

00:39:40.892 --> 00:39:42.436
Enemy forces are in the corridor!

00:39:42.644 --> 00:39:44.730
Commander, shall I use gas to wipe them out?

00:39:44.938 --> 00:39:46.106
Wait!

00:39:46.314 --> 00:39:50.235
I'll talk with the commander outside.
Open a channel.

00:39:52.154 --> 00:39:54.406
Brother, remember!

00:39:56.950 --> 00:39:58.785
Damn you!

00:40:32.235 --> 00:40:35.155
We desire a cease-fire.

00:40:35.363 --> 00:40:37.949
We have no wish for further fighting.

00:40:38.158 --> 00:40:39.075
A woman?

00:40:39.284 --> 00:40:41.495
| am this base's commanding officer,

00:40:41.703 --> 00:40:43.663
Leila Breisgau.

00:40:43.872 --> 00:40:45.373
Commander.

00:40:46.833 --> 00:40:49.628
| know a wonderful painting.

00:40:49.836 --> 00:40:51.838
There was an angel and a woman...

00:40:52.047 --> 00:40:56.676
It had a woman who looked a lot like you in it.

00:40:56.885 --> 00:41:03.266
This is the painting. I think it was
hanging in the house I was born in.

00:41:04.434 --> 00:41:07.312
Did you like this painting?

00:41:08.438 --> 00:41:10.816
I'm not sure.

00:41:11.024 --> 00:41:15.028
But I do love the kind expression...

00:41:16.988 --> 00:41:19.533
...on this woman's face.

00:41:19.741 --> 00:41:21.243
"Akito..."

00:41:24.788 --> 00:41:25.872
Commander?

00:41:26.081 --> 00:41:29.251
It. Col. Warwick, we're scuttling
the command center.

00:41:37.300 --> 00:41:39.427
It's hard to believe this is the same Akito.

00:41:47.102 --> 00:41:48.645
Brother!

00:42:07.122 --> 00:42:09.416
| won't give you an easy death!

00:42:49.372 --> 00:42:50.874
Ryo!

00:43:01.384 --> 00:43:03.637
| won't let you kill my teammate!

00:43:15.523 --> 00:43:19.152
You're just as tough as I hoped you'd be!

00:43:30.914 --> 00:43:33.500
Ashley, I'll start with you!

00:43:46.054 --> 00:43:48.515
Stop it!

00:45:00.879 --> 00:45:02.422
Akito!

00:45:05.633 --> 00:45:08.720
Crap, this thing is stuck!

00:45:12.057 --> 00:45:13.558
Akito!

00:45:16.644 --> 00:45:17.979
--Akito!
--Akito!

00:45:18.188 --> 00:45:19.689
Akito!

00:45:27.155 --> 00:45:28.698
Mother...

00:45:30.158 --> 00:45:31.951
Mother...

00:45:32.160 --> 00:45:35.121
Farewell, Mother.

00:45:35.330 --> 00:45:40.460
Now you won't have to suffer anymore.

00:45:46.049 --> 00:45:47.926
Big brother...

00:45:51.429 --> 00:45:53.306
Brother...

00:45:55.308 --> 00:45:57.977
Why are you alive?

00:46:00.355 --> 00:46:02.941
This world is mad.

00:46:03.149 --> 00:46:06.277
The thought of an innocent like you

00:46:06.486 --> 00:46:08.988
suffering in this mad world, Akito...

00:46:10.532 --> 00:46:12.450
It's too much to bear.

00:46:25.255 --> 00:46:28.174
Akito, die.

00:46:38.226 --> 00:46:41.437
Brother, this has to stop.

00:46:41.646 --> 00:46:44.440
Slaughtering each other won't solve anything.

00:46:44.649 --> 00:46:47.861
You're right, it won't solve anything.

00:46:48.069 --> 00:46:51.948
But that's what people want.

00:46:52.157 --> 00:46:55.535
So do you, Akito. You enjoy fighting.

00:46:55.743 --> 00:46:56.703
<i>You'r e wrong!</i>

00:46:56.911 --> 00:46:59.873
So die, Akito!

00:47:00.081 --> 00:47:04.043
Vanish from this world!

00:47:05.587 --> 00:47:10.008
Akito!

00:47:22.604 --> 00:47:25.773
I'll kill you, Akito!

00:47:27.692 --> 00:47:32.071
Death is a blessing! All humans will die!

00:47:33.323 --> 00:47:35.033
--Stop it!
--Stop it!

00:47:35.241 --> 00:47:36.159
Stop it!

00:47:36.367 --> 00:47:37.952
Filthy spirits!

00:47:38.161 --> 00:47:41.497
You, who love your younger brother so,

00:47:41.706 --> 00:47:45.877
wish to release your loved ones
from the curse of this world.

00:47:46.085 --> 00:47:47.921
Your desire...

00:47:48.129 --> 00:47:50.965
Your kindhearted desire is clear.

00:47:51.174 --> 00:47:54.093
But perhaps you are mistaken.

00:47:54.302 --> 00:47:56.221
There is no mistake!

00:47:57.472 --> 00:48:01.267
We know because you loved us.

00:48:01.476 --> 00:48:04.437
But you might be wrong.

00:48:04.646 --> 00:48:10.068
This world might contain more
possibilities than you think.

00:48:10.276 --> 00:48:11.903
That woman...

00:48:13.321 --> 00:48:15.865
...believes that to be true.

00:48:18.284 --> 00:48:21.955
There is no hope in this world!

00:48:23.748 --> 00:48:26.542
Please don't kill Akito.

00:48:26.751 --> 00:48:30.129
Akito means that much to you?

00:48:30.338 --> 00:48:33.299
You didn't kill Akito back then, either!

00:48:33.508 --> 00:48:37.303
| loved you just as much.

00:48:39.722 --> 00:48:41.432
Liar!

00:48:50.775 --> 00:48:53.027
No, Brother!

00:48:53.236 --> 00:48:55.196
That's exactly why--

